'd like for her to be in the clothes of her second image, but if you want to design your own clothes/make your own Mel clone, that's fine as well! Whatever's easiest for you. I leave the scene and composition up to you!\n\nIf possible, please deliver a PSD file with the sign layer separate from the illustration. Thanks, have a good day!", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mikaduki1224/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3927844, "client_id": 177871, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74aca559/uploads/origins/bcf08e91-428d-4ac8-8399-fb3ed1f001c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ca08566c0ceb2ec47774419695a53ea", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74aca559/uploads/origins/bcf08e91-428d-4ac8-8399-fb3ed1f001c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ca08566c0ceb2ec47774419695a53ea, https://si.imgix.net/74aca559/uploads/origins/bcf08e91-428d-4ac8-8399-fb3ed1f001c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d45097b809940821efae7a71efa00629 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74aca559/uploads/origins/bcf08e91-428d-4ac8-8399-fb3ed1f001c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f26b3c6fab2ca1608d30ca2851dbb45a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74aca559/uploads/origins/bcf08e91-428d-4ac8-8399-fb3ed1f001c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2b51109588d839210460890a479ddbb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74aca559/uploads/origins/bcf08e91-428d-4ac8-8399-fb3ed1f001c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2b51109588d839210460890a479ddbb, https://si.imgix.net/74aca559/uploads/origins/bcf08e91-4