e the cool girls…! \nI’d be happy if I could request an illustration of my character <Ariel>.\n\nAriel: https://toyhou.se/32794094.oc-refs/32794370.ariel-aviyt/gallery?key=NsBT00XX6lVhAcI  \n\nPlease choose the outfit you prefer from the URL above. Ariel is a cute and cheerful girl with a sly and calculating side. \n\nI’d be happy if るかさん could draw an illustration that portrays the gap between her cute appearance and her calculating nature. Or, something like making a gun with her fingers like “bang!” It’s also fine to draw her freely from your imagination. Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@moe8754/works/66", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3520090, "client_id": 3927844, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b74ad5d7/uploads/origins/485ef2c6-2846-4a76-a139-0c4a01cb9bf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=210096e171a291b82d25133834149ba6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b74ad5d7/uploads/origins/485ef2c6-2846-4a76-a139-0c4a01cb9bf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=210096e171a291b82d25133834149ba6, https://si.imgix.net/b74ad5d7/uploads/origins/485ef2c6-2846-4a76-a139-0c4a01cb9bf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c65965775600c790af015cf7239ed107 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b74ad5d7/uploads/origins/485ef2c6-2846-4a76-a139-0c4a01cb9bf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb7df3a72667b824c1cd48e2d4c34b64 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b74ad5d7/uploads/origins/485ef2c6-2846-4a76-a139-0c4a01cb9bf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9836d420284aaf41f3d5f8c0b